				<dt>Views</dt>
				<dd>2608</dd>
			</dl>
			
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="artclViewTitleWrap">
		<h2 class="artclViewTitle">
			
			
			2026, 2027 학부 외국인 특별전형 모집 계획 알림 Undergraduate admission for foreign students for 2026, 2027 
		</h2>
		<div class="artclShare">
			<div class="left">
				
			</div>
			<div class="right">
				
				
				
				
				
				
				
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	
	<div class="artclView">
		
			
				<p>안녕하세요&nbsp;</p>
<p>2026학년도 및 2027학년도 학부 외국인 특별전형 모집 계획을 붙임과 같이 안내드리오니, 향후 해당년도 모집 시 많은 지원 바랍니다.&nbsp;</p>
<p><br></p>
<p data-start="105" data-end="131"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">We are pleased to inform you of the </span><strong data-start="169" data-end="216" style="font-size: 10pt;">Undergraduate International Admissions Plan</strong><span style="font-size: 10pt;"> for the </span><strong data-start="225" data-end="257" style="font-size: 10pt;">2026 and 2027 academic years</strong><span style="font-size: 10pt;">. Please find the attached document for details.</span></p>
<p data-start="309" data-end="392">We look forward to receiving many applications in the upcoming admission periods.</p>
<p data-start="394" data-end="462">Best regards,</p>
<p data-start="394" data-end="462"><br></p>
<p data-start="564" data-end="619">您好！我们在此通知您<strong data-start="574" data-end="606">2026学年度及2027学年度本科外国留学生特别招生计划</strong>，详情请参阅附件文件。</p>
<p data-start="621" data-end="640">期待在未来的招生期间收到更多申请！</p>
